-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- 4. Non-ergodic population averaging
-- Molenaar (2004); docs/language-is-trained-synesthesia.md §11.1:
-- Two deterministic individuals (a , b) : Bool × Bool: individual 1 is invariant (a ↦ a),
-- individual 2 oscillates (b ↦ not b). Each individual has a trivial deterministic law.
ens-step : Bool × Bool → Bool × Bool
ens-step j = (fst j , not (snd j))
